    "detailed_description": "<h1>Other games from our friends</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>&quot;The Alpha Wolf&quot; is a RPG simulator game that puts you in the paws of a wolf, where you will need to navigate the wilderness and prove yourself as the alpha of your pack.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Mechanics: Hunt, Survive, Quest, and Upgrade</h2>As the main character, you will need to engage in various mechanics to survive and thrive. One of the main mechanics of the game is hunting and killing animals to feed yourself and your pack. You will also need to survive the attacks of other predators while exploring the open world. Completing quests will earn you gold and gems that can allow you to upgrade your wolf, increasing your chances of survival and dominance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313830/extras/5c074811903654aab5c60bb94bd9cfeb.poster.avif?t=1748411009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313830/extras/5c074811903654aab5c60bb94bd9cfeb.webm?t=1748411009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Gathering and Upgrading Your Wolf Pack</strong><br><br>To further enhance your wolf's abilities, you can gather and upgrade your own wolf pack. You can upgrade their strength, speed, attack, and defense, and with them, you can take on stronger animals and defend against stronger predators.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313830/extras/dd29af75ade552ac702411efedd0b458.poster.avif?t=1748411009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313830/extras/dd29af75ade552ac702411efedd0b458.webm?t=1748411009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Fights Against Animal Tribes</h2><br>As you progress through the game, you will encounter boss fights against the head of the tribe of every other animal. These bosses include the Deer Boss, Boar Boss, and the Bear Boss, which will require different strategies and skills to defeat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313830/extras/d917f9061862cf5f36c7ab0ac27913b1.poster.avif?t=1748411009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313830/extras/d917f9061862cf5f36c7ab0ac27913b1.webm?t=1748411009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magic Skills to Enhance Your Wolf's Abilities</h2><br>To unlock even more power, you can unlock magic skills by leveling up and earning skill points. These magic skills are categorized into Basic, Special, Aura, and Totem skills, each providing unique benefits to your wolf.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313830/extras/975d2d5a7525a0676c056ecd94d2eb48.poster.avif?t=1748411009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313830/extras/975d2d5a7525a0676c056ecd94d2eb48.webm?t=1748411009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Overall, &quot;The Alpha Wolf&quot; offers a thrilling and immersive RPG simulator experience, where you can experience life as a wolf and prove yourself as the alpha of your pack.",
